{
  "story": "Cambridge Power Up 3 Pupil’s Book CD1 track 15, local PU3 T1 PB P14-15.mp3",
  "cuts": [
    {
      "clip": 1,
      "start": 8.400000000000002,
      "end": 13.0,
      "text": "Can you imagine being in a circus?"
    },
    {
      "clip": 2,
      "start": 13.0,
      "end": 24.36,
      "text": "Travelling all over the world, playing with clowns, flying through the air on a trapeze, or jumping on trampolines all day?"
    },
    {
      "clip": 3,
      "start": 24.36,
      "end": 28.490000000000002,
      "text": "No? Well, let me tell you about it."
    },
    {
      "clip": 4,
      "start": 28.490000000000002,
      "end": 31.17,
      "text": "My name is Anastasia."
    },
    {
      "clip": 5,
      "start": 31.17,
      "end": 33.730000000000004,
      "text": "I was born in the circus."
    },
    {
      "clip": 6,
      "start": 33.730000000000004,
      "end": 47.36,
      "text": "My parents are Russian acrobats with Captain Adventure’s Travelling Circus and my dream was always to be just like them and perform on stage."
    },
    {
      "clip": 7,
      "start": 47.36,
      "end": 53.53,
      "text": "Every day I wanted to ask Dad when I could go on stage with him."
    },
    {
      "clip": 8,
      "start": 53.53,
      "end": 56.08,
      "text": "But I was afraid to."
    },
    {
      "clip": 9,
      "start": 56.08,
      "end": 58.75,
      "text": "I didn’t know if I was ready."
    },
    {
      "clip": 10,
      "start": 58.75,
      "end": 64.15,
      "text": "In the mornings I had classes with a teacher online."
    },
    {
      "clip": 11,
      "start": 64.15,
      "end": 67.13,
      "text": "They started at nine o’clock."
    },
    {
      "clip": 12,
      "start": 67.13,
      "end": 71.09,
      "text": "My parents said I had to do well at school."
    },
    {
      "clip": 13,
      "start": 71.09,
      "end": 77.17,
      "text": "In the afternoons I practised acrobatics with my dad for hours."
    },
    {
      "clip": 14,
      "start": 77.17,
      "end": 81.72,
      "text": "We practised until dinner at half past seven."
    },
    {
      "clip": 15,
      "start": 81.72,
      "end": 86.61,
      "text": "My dad helped me improve and learn new moves."
    },
    {
      "clip": 16,
      "start": 86.61,
      "end": 93.03,
      "text": "“Let’s try a backflip,” he said one day, ready to catch me if I fell."
    },
    {
      "clip": 17,
      "start": 93.03,
      "end": 97.9,
      "text": "I couldn’t do backflips then, but I can now."
    },
    {
      "clip": 18,
      "start": 97.9,
      "end": 103.71,
      "text": "“Great! Again! Fantastic! Again!” he told me."
    },
    {
      "clip": 19,
      "start": 103.71,
      "end": 105.91,
      "text": "I practised a lot."
    },
    {
      "clip": 20,
      "start": 105.91,
      "end": 108.46000000000001,
      "text": "I really wanted to do it."
    },
    {
      "clip": 21,
      "start": 108.46000000000001,
      "end": 114.75999999999999,
      "text": "After training, my friend Yuri usually came over to give me support."
    },
    {
      "clip": 22,
      "start": 114.75999999999999,
      "end": 119.39,
      "text": "“Soon,” he always said, and hugged me."
    },
    {
      "clip": 23,
      "start": 119.39,
      "end": 128.39,
      "text": "I practised really hard every day for years, then last month it finally happened."
    },
    {
      "clip": 24,
      "start": 128.39,
      "end": 135.11,
      "text": "Dad said, “I think you are ready to go on stage now. How about Saturday?”"
    },
    {
      "clip": 25,
      "start": 135.11,
      "end": 140.2,
      "text": "“Really?” I shouted and jumped up and down."
    },
    {
      "clip": 26,
      "start": 140.2,
      "end": 144.98000000000002,
      "text": "Immediately, I ran to tell Yuri the good news."
    },
    {
      "clip": 27,
      "start": 144.98000000000002,
      "end": 148.79,
      "text": "“I told you!” he laughed."
    },
    {
      "clip": 28,
      "start": 148.79,
      "end": 153.55,
      "text": "“You practised a lot, and practice makes perfect.”"
    },
    {
      "clip": 29,
      "start": 153.55,
      "end": 157.28,
      "text": "And that was how my dream came true."
    },
    {
      "clip": 30,
      "start": 157.28,
      "end": 160.94,
      "text": "Now I perform in the circus every week."
    }
  ],
